Package: inboggvegan
Type: Package
Title: Extended Biplot and Screeplot Functionality for the 'vegan' Package
Version: 0.7.0
Date: 2026-11-12
Authors@R: 
    person("Pieter", "Verschelde", email = "pieter.verschelde@inbo.be",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9199-421X"))
Description: Provides 'ggplot2'-based ordination plots, biplots, screeplots,
    surface contour plots, hull/spider diagrams, and environmental vector fits
    for multivariate objects from 'vegan' (rda, cca, capscale, metaMDS, envfit)
    and 'stats' (prcomp, princomp).
